{"author":{"id":"ad87ffa09351c4e5a412ec8ee1546e86b314f33d6f28629bb4bcfe7b2290924d"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1794306289,"nonce":"kEFbbA5PzPypmx1klGPIJZKdsX0=","title":"Cloze cards for parts of a fused word","message":"Parts of a fused word (fr du = de + le, au = à + le; pl poszedłem = poszedł + em) get no cloze card: clozeOf skips tokens with mwt. The analysis gives every part the fused token's span (analysis/src/skolia_analysis/blob.py), and the cloze table's UNIQUE (document_id, sentence_start, blank_start) and makeCloze's lookup ignore the lemma, so parts would share one card.\n\nTo allow them: add the lemma or part index to the cloze row and its unique key, blank the whole fused surface, and hint every part (de + le) or the whole form (poszedłem's verb plus person ending). Most useful for Polish past tenses.","files":null}]}